227
00:12:48,156 --> 00:12:50,376
[SPEAKER_02]: And you didn't yell from the other side.

228
00:12:50,536 --> 00:12:52,397
[SPEAKER_02]: I'm here, and my roommate's here.

229
00:12:52,737 --> 00:12:56,558
[SPEAKER_02]: You had to open the door, and the trainer had to see both of you.

230
00:12:57,318 --> 00:12:57,718
[SPEAKER_02]: All right.

231
00:12:58,278 --> 00:12:58,599
[SPEAKER_02]: At 12.

232
00:13:00,843 --> 00:13:06,505
[SPEAKER_02]: wear it in and out, you were fined a pretty good hunk, $200.

233
00:13:07,526 --> 00:13:11,708
[SPEAKER_02]: No whiskey drinking on the club.

234
00:13:12,228 --> 00:13:17,130
[SPEAKER_02]: $250 fine if anybody was caught drinking even a small jigger of whiskey.

235
00:13:19,071 --> 00:13:26,594
[SPEAKER_02]: Nine o'clock in the morning, you had to be in the restroom, and we all signed our checks.

236
00:13:29,298 --> 00:13:36,543
[SPEAKER_02]: And the trainer was sitting at the front door of the restaurant, checking everybody in.

237
00:13:36,563 --> 00:13:37,504
[SPEAKER_02]: He had his sheet.

238
00:13:38,384 --> 00:13:42,607
[SPEAKER_02]: He'd check you in, what time you got in, and if you're nine o'clock, you weren't there.

239
00:13:42,767 --> 00:13:45,009
