240
00:13:45,689 --> 00:13:50,333
[SPEAKER_02]: Now, you had to sign your checks, and we were allowed $4.50 a day to eat on.

241
00:13:52,834 --> 00:13:56,717
[SPEAKER_02]: And you signed your checks, and you paid your tips out of your own pocket.

242
00:13:58,984 --> 00:14:08,268
