259
00:14:57,723 --> 00:15:01,245
[SPEAKER_02]: Then in 35, I had it operated on.

260
00:15:01,285 --> 00:15:04,207
[SPEAKER_02]: Then in 36, I pitched in the World Series against the Yankees.

261
00:15:04,807 --> 00:15:08,690
[SPEAKER_02]: That's when I had my arm operated on, in 1935.

262
00:15:10,351 --> 00:15:11,931
