00:16:31,763 --> 00:16:32,444
[SPEAKER_02]: Oh, yeah.

293
00:16:32,464 --> 00:16:34,764
[SPEAKER_02]: They just didn't step in too much.

294
00:16:35,064 --> 00:16:37,045
[SPEAKER_02]: And Schumacher and Hubble and myself.

295
00:16:37,825 --> 00:16:39,025
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah, we were pretty hard.

296
00:16:39,045 --> 00:16:41,366
[SPEAKER_01]: Did you have any trouble with wildness at all?

297
00:16:41,566 --> 00:16:42,066
[SPEAKER_01]: Me?

298
00:16:42,286 --> 00:16:42,706
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, no.

299
00:16:43,107 --> 00:16:43,827
[SPEAKER_01]: No, no.

